  <string name="legal_intro">Independent GB/GBC/GBA app by Bruma Studio. Not affiliated with Nintendo. No games or proprietary BIOS are included. Core: mGBA 0.10.5. Original BRUMA-derived code: GPL-3.0-or-later.</string>
  <string name="privacy_body">Games, saves, your library, favorites, play time and settings stay on this device. No ads, analytics, accounts or referrals. Cover downloads are optional: after your consent, Libretro and its GitHub mirror receive your IP and requested game title/platform. Downloads can run after scans if you enable that setting. ROMs and saves are never uploaded. Exports use the Android document picker. Clearing app data removes private saves; export them first.</string>
